      <p><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2" color="#660000"><b>Frank 
        H. Benson</b> of Smyrna died Monday, March 8, 1999, in Kent General Hospital. 
        He was 69.&nbsp; Mr. Benson was born Nov. 30, 1929, in Dover, the son 
        of the Samuel E. and Elizabeth Benson.&nbsp; He was a farmer.</font> </p>
      <p><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2" color="#660000">He 
        is survived by a son, Franklin Benson of Smyrna; two brothers, Fred Benson 
        and John Benson of Dover; and five sisters, Laura Huggins of Bridgeton, 
        N.J., Dorothy Williams and Mary Benson, both of Dover, Carrie Mosley of 
        Frederica and Catherine Benson of Vineland, N.J.</font> </p>
      <p><font face="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2" color="#660000">Service 
        will be noon today at Minus Funeral Home, Dover, where friends may call 
        one hour prior to the service. Bishop Dorinea Miles will officiate.&nbsp; 
